<p>The last Mandan Historical Society general membership meeting was held on November 13, 2011. During the interim, vacancies on the Board of Directors have been filled by appointment by the Society's President, as provided in the Bylaws. The current members currently serve on the Board of Directors. If you would like more information, contact us at info@mandanhistory.org</p>

